WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.853
A taxi or rideshare trip can start with a quick safety check.

2
00:00:03.853 --> 00:00:08.401
Check the car and driver details in your app before you go near the car.

3
00:00:08.401 --> 00:00:14.022
If the details do not match or you feel unsure, do not get in. Contact someone you trust.

4
00:00:14.022 --> 00:00:19.581
Tell the driver the destination and check it together. Then choose a seat and buckle up.

5
00:00:19.581 --> 00:00:25.076
If you want, share your trip details with someone you trust. You can stay on the phone.

6
00:00:25.076 --> 00:00:29.687
When you arrive, check you have your belongings before you leave the car.

7
00:00:29.687 --> 00:00:36.240
Your safety comes first. It is okay to pause, ask questions, or cancel the trip.
